{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 39, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e2b-it", "content": "Hark traveler to Nippon land\nA journey grand a wondrous strand\nPrepare thyself for sights untold\nA tale of beauty brave and bold.\n\n**First Day: Arrival in Tokyo's Gate**\n\nFrom whence thou art arrive with grace\nTo Narita's realm a bustling place\nThy luggage claim thy weary soul\nAnd onward hence to Shinjuku's role.\nA hotel find a place to rest\nAnd feast upon a savory test\nOf ramen broth and sushi bright\nA culinary star in darkest night.\n\n**Second Day: Ancient Echoes Bloom**\n\nTo Asakusa then we do proceed\nWhere Senso-ji's temple doth indeed\nStand proud and tall a mystic sight\nBathed in the morning's golden light.\nExplore the Nakamise-dori lane\nWith trinkets charms to ease thy pain\nThen venture forth to Ueno Park\nWhere museums stand a shining arc.\n\n**Third Day: Imperial Majesty Appears**\n\nTo Imperial Palace we now turn\nWhere history's lessons brightly burn\nObserve the gardens green and wide\nAnd ponder secrets deep inside.\nThen Ginza's splendor shall unfold\nWith boutiques grand and stories told\nOf fashion trends and luxury's gleam\nA shopper's paradise a waking dream.\n\n**Fourth Day: Hakone's Misty Veil**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's shore\nWhere mountains rise forevermore\nA cruise upon Lake Ashi's breast\nA tranquil haven truly blessed.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum grand\nDisplays of art throughout the land\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm\nA peaceful respite from worldly harm.\n\n**Fifth Day: Kyoto's Ancient Charm**\n\nBy train we ride to Kyoto's keep\nWhere ancient temples softly sleep\nKinkaku-ji's gold reflects the sun\nA vision fair for everyone.\nFushimi Inari's gates so red\nA thousand torii overhead\nA mystic path a journey long\nWhere prayers are whispered in a song.\n\n**Sixth Day: Gion's Geisha Grace**\n\nTo Gion's district we now do stray\nWhere geishas glide in graceful way\nA hidden world of artistry\nA whispered legend for thee to see.\nExplore Kiyomizu-dera's height\nA wooden stage a wondrous sight\nAnd wander through the narrow lanes\nWhere history forever reigns.\n\n**Seventh Day: Nara's Deer Delight**\n\nTo Nara we journey light and free\nWhere friendly deer roam wild and glee\nTodai-ji's Buddha large and bold\nA story ancient to be told.\nThe Great Buddha's form serene and vast\nA symbol of a future cast\nIn wisdom peace and gentle grace\nA sacred haven a tranquil space.\n\n**Eighth Day: Farewell Nippon's Land**\n\nWith heavy heart we bid adieu\nTo Nippon's beauty fresh and new\nReturn to Tokyo's bustling air\nAnd cherish memories beyond compare.\nDepart with gratitude and might\nAnd dream of journeys in the light\nUntil we meet on future days\nIn lands of wonder and amaze.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.0029929152224212885}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -1.3351351299206726e-05}, {"token": "▁traveler", "logprob": -1.0791597366333008}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.011780809611082077}, {"token": "▁Nippon", "logprob": -0.721026599407196}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -0.5653541684150696}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.5158605575561523}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.008262735791504383}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.0197045486420393}, {"token": "▁grand", "logprob": -0.013674275949597359}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.017483169212937355}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.23150436580181122}, {"token": "▁strand", "logprob": -0.34979522228240967}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.05118301883339882}, {"token": "Prepare", "logprob": -0.12190837413072586}, {"token": "▁thys", "logprob": -0.314034104347229}, {"token": "elf", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.0007933806627988815}, {"token": "▁sights", "logprob": -0.0031513336580246687}, {"token": "▁untold", "logprob": -0.06329862773418427}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.00012981049076188356}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.017840392887592316}, {"token": "▁tale", "logprob": -0.05